6. Reliance is placed upon the judgment of this Court in the case of Aijaz Ahmad vs. Niyaz Ahmad Khan and Anr.; 1975 SCC OnLine All 111 wherein this Court after considering the similar issue with regard to removal of a Gram Pradhan and alleged involvement in the cow slaughter, had interfered and relying upon a Full Bench decision in the case of Buddha Pitai vs. Sub-Divisional officer; AIR 1965 All 382 as well as another judgment of this Court in the case of Mangali vs. Chhakki Lal & Ors.;
AIR 1963 All 527, held that the removal of Pradhan was not proper and the order of removal was quashed, however, the final relief was not granted as the election had already been held.
